#| msgid ""
#| "By signing up on our site you agree to our terms and conditions [link].  We'll create a new user account for you based on your submissions.  All data you submit will be stored on our servers.  After your registration we'll instantly send you an email with an "
#| "activation link to verify your mail address.   "
msgid ""
"By signing up on our site you agree to our terms and conditions [link]. "
"We'll create a new user account for you based on your submissions. All data "
"you submit will be stored on our servers.After your registration we'll "
"instantly send you an email with an activation link to verify your mail "
"address. "
msgstr ""
"Al registrarse en nuestro sitio usted acepta nuestros términos y "
"condiciones[link]. \n"
